OR1     S1    O1x  SIDE  0       0.65  NO

[XSECTIONS]
;; Standard section order: this row comes after the orifice's row.
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4
OR1     CIRCULAR  0.5    0      0      0

[REPORT]
NODES ALL
